        "sid": "1KI 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Ben-hadad m’ubimo mi Cami coko udul pare ceke karacelo; man ubimo pier adek wi ario ni kude, ku riuni man magali: man eidho malu etieko Samaria de kud ali, man ekiedo i kume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man eoro jukwenda bang’ Ahab m’ubimo mir Israel, i adhura, man ewacu ire kumae, Ben-hadad uwacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mola ma tar peri ku mola ma kwar peri en e para; mon peri bende ku nyithindho peri, cil ma ber m’usagu, gi para. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ubimo mir Israel uloko lembe man ewacu kumae, En e calku lembawaca peri, rwoth para, E ubimo; an a peri, ku gin ceke m’abedo ko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jukwenda gibino kendo, e giwacu kumae, Ben-hadad uwacu kumae, Aoro kwenda i beng’i andha, awacu kumae, Ibimio mola ma tar peri ira, ku mola ma kwar peri, ku mon peri, man nyithindho peri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento abioro jutic para i beng’i urwo unyoni, man gibiyenyo i ot peri, kud i udi mi jutic peri; man ebibedo, nia gin ceke ma tek e ber i weng’i, gibigame i cing’gi, e gibikabe woko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubimo mir Israel ulund ulwong’o judongo ceke m’i ng’om, man ewacu kumae, Akwayuwu, wung’i man wunen maram ng’atu maeni beyenya ko ku rop: kum eoro kwenda i bang’a pi mon para, man pi nyithindho para, man pi mola ma tar para, man pi mola ma kwar para; e akwere ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man judongo ceke ku dhanu ceke giwacu ire kumae, Kud iwinji, kadok ayia de kud iyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno ewacu ni jukwenda pa Ben-hadad kumae, Wuyer ni rwoth para m’ubimo kumae, Gin ceke m’ilar ioro pire ba jatic peri abitimo; ento gin maeni acopo timo ngo. Man jukwenda giai, e gikelo lembe i bang’e kendo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Ben-hadad uoro kwenda i bang’e, man ewacu kumae, Mungu tim kumeno i bang’a, man mange bende, tek utur mi Samaria biromo pong’ cing’ dhanu ceke ma bilubo ng’eye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ubimo mir Israel uloko lembe man ewacu kumae, Wuyer ire kumae, Ng’atu m’utwio jambali pare kud elule gire calu ng’atu m’uwodhe cen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, kinde ma Ben-hadad uwinjo rwonglembe maeni, kan ebemadhu, en ku ju m’ubimo, i hema, nia ewacu ni jutic pare kumae, Wutheru. Man githeri kum adhurane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man, nen, jabila moko bino ceng’ni bang’ Ahab m’ubimo mir Israel, man ewacu kumae, Yehova wacu kumae, Ineno udul ma dit maeni ceke? nen, abimie i cingi tin; e ibing’eyo nia an a Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Ahab uwacu kumae, Ni kum ng’a? Man ewacu kumae, Yehova wacu kumae, Ni kum awobi mi judongomawijo mi ng’et ng’om. Elund ewacu kumae, Ng’a ma bitheko lwinyi? E eloko lembe kumae, In. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elund ecoko awobi mi judongomawijo mi ng’et ng’om, man gi dak ario ku pier adek wi ario: e yo ku ng’eigi ecoko dhanu ceke, en e nyithindho mir Israel ceke, ma gi rubanga abiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwok woko dieceng’. Ento Ben-hadad ubemadhre m’emer ko i hema, en ku ju m’ubimo pier adek wi ario ma konye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man awobi mi judongomawijo mi ng’et ng’om gilar giwok woko; e Ben-hadad uoro kwenda woko, man giyero ire, giwacu kumae, Dhanu moko giwok woko ku i Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ewacu kumae, Tek giwok woko mi kwiocwiny, wumakgi ma kwo; kadi tek giwok woko mir ali, wumakgi ma kwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno jumaeni giwok woko ku i adhura, ma gin awobi mi judongomawijo mi ng’et ng’om, man njuru asikari m’ulubogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ginego kubang’gi kubang’gi ng’atuman dhanu pare; e Jucami giringo, man Israel uriemo gi: man Ben-hadad m’ubimo mi Cami uboth ku wi riuni giku weg riuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ubimo mir Israel uwok woko, man egoyo riuni ku magali, man enego Jucami ku nek ma dit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jabilane bino ceng’ni bang’ ubimo mir Israel, ewacu de ire kumae, Cidhi, itegri giri, man ing’i, inen de gin m’itimo; kum ka rundi dwogo ubimo mi Cami biidho malu i kumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jutic mir ubimo mi Cami uwacu ire kumae, Mungu migi en e mungu mi gudi; kum kumeno gi tek ma sagu wan; ento wek wakiedu kugi i pambu, man wabibedo tek ma sagugi andha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man itim gin maeni: kab ju m’ubimo woko, ku ba dhanu ceke kud i kakare, man iketh jego i kakagi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man ikwan iri njuru asikari, calu njuru asikari m’urwinyo iri, rium pi riuni, man magali pi magali; e wabikiedo i kumgi i pambu, e wabibedo tek ma sagugi andha. E ewinjo dwandgi, man etimo kumeca.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre ka rundi dwogo nia Ben-hadad ucoko Jucami, man eidho bang’ Afek, kara ekied kum Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E jucoko nyithindho mir Israel, ku mio igi cemo de, man gicidho i kumgi: man nyithindho mir Israel ugonjo i wang’gi calu udul ario ma nok mi nyithi diegi; ento Jucami gipong’o ng’om. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man dhanu pa Mungu bino ceng’ni eyero de ni ubimo mir Israel, man ewacu kumae, Yehova wacu kumae, Kum Jucami wacu kumae, Yehova en e mungu mir ungulu gudi, ento en e mungu mi poga ngo; ka kumeno abimio udul ma dit maeni ceke i cingi, man wubing’eyo nia an a Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E gigonjo man yo ba wadi man yo ba wadi ceng’ abiro. E ebedo kumeno, nia i ceng’ mir abirone ali moc; man nyithindho mir Israel unego kind Jucami dhanu ma ku tielo rubanga dak acel i ceng’ acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento donge m’udong’ giringo i Afek, i adhura; man gang’kidi podho wi dhanu rubanga pier ario wi abiro m’udong’. E Ben-hadad uringo, man edok i adhura, i kusika ma yor i ie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jutic pare wacu ire kumae, Kawono nen, wawinjo nia ubimo mi ot mir Israel gin ubimo ma weg kisa: wakwei, wek watwi pierwa ku gonia, ku uno i wiwa, man waci woko bang’ ubimo mir Israel: kuno nyo ebibodho kwo peri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno gitwio piergi ku gonia, e giketho uno i wigi, man gibino bang’ ubimo mir Israel, giwacu de kumae, Jatic peri ma Ben-hadad uwacu kumae, Akwei, wek abed kwo. Man ewacu kumae, Fodi ebedo kwo? en e umira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nie dhanu ging’io cu, man gitimo pio kara ging’ei tek en e pidoie pare; e giwacu kumae, Umeru Ben-hadad. Elund ewacu kumae, Wucidhi, wukele. Ben-hadad ulund uwok woko i bang’e: man eketho eidh malu i magali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Ben-hadad uwacu ire kumae, Adhura ma vwa mayu ba wuru abidwoko; man ibitimo gengi iri i Dameski, calu vwa timo i Samaria. Man an, Ahab uwacu, abiweki icidh ku lembariba maeni. Kum kumeno gitimo lembariba gikude, man giwek ecidho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ng’atu moko ma kind wot jubila wacu ni wadi ku lembe pa Yehova kumae, Akwei, goya. Man ng’atuca kwero goye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.13.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ub 13:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elund ewacu ire kumae, Kum iworo dwand Yehova ngo, nen, kinde m’iai i bang’a, umvor binegi. Man kinde m’eai i bang’e, umvor unwang’e, man enege. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elund enwang’u ng’atu mange, man ewacu kumae, Akwei, goya. E ng’atu maeno goye, egoye m’etong’o ko lero i kume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno jabilane ai, man ekuro ubimo dhu yo, e epale gire ku kitambala pare i wang’e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E kinde m’ubimo kadhu, ekok bang’ ubimone; man ewacu kumae, Jatic peri cidho woko i kind lwiny; man, nen, ng’atu acel ulokre cen, man ekelo ng’atu moko i bang’a, e ewacu kumae, Gwok ng’atu maeni: tek erwinyo ku yo moko, kwo peri bilund bedo pi kwo pare, k adi ibiculo talanto acel mi mola ma tar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ka jatic peri betimo tic keni man kuca, e ecidho. Man ubimo mir Israel uwacu ire kumae, Lembapoka peri bibedo kumeca; in giri iketho lembene cungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimo pio, e ekabu kitambala woko kud i wang’e; man ubimo mir Israel ung’iye nia en e ng’atu acel ma kind jubila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ewacu ire kumae, Yehova wacu kumae, Kum iweko ng’atu m’akethe mi nyoth, ka kumeno kwo peri bibedo ka kwo pare man dhanu peri ka dhanu pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ubimo mir Israel ucidho ba ot pare ku cwinye m’udieng’ ma lembe ton i ie de, man ebino Samaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
